[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the\nramp.</p><p>FOR LEFT BRAKE DISC</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429257\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>FOR RIGHT BRAKE DISC</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429152\">3310A48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the front brake disc shield (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044719.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the front brake disc\nshield back in its housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429152\">3310A48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>FOR RIGHT BRAKE DISC</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429258\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>FOR LEFT BRAKE DISC</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429257\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]